📊 Social Media Engagement Analysis


📌 Project Overview

This project explores a social media engagement dataset using Python. It
combines data inspection, cleaning, NumPy/Pandas operations, descriptive
statistics, and visualizations built with Matplotlib, Seaborn, and
Plotly.

The notebook works with a dataset of 5,000 records and 19 columns.
The fields include post and user information, age, gender, country, post
type and category, likes, comments, shares, watch time, impressions,
posting timestamp, follower count, verification status, device type,
sentiment, hashtags, and engagement rate.

