tail(), shape, columns, info(), and describe().

Data exploration --- value counts, unique categories, grouping,
and correlation analysis.

Data wrangling --- calculate engagement_score as likes +
comments + shares; count hashtags; summarize average likes, total
shares, and post counts by post type, country, and sentiment.

